WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.660
Reiji sent me to the Xyz Dimension.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.420
He said I'd find my next opponent there.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.860
I made a vow that I would save 
the world with entertainment!

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.190
That's...

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.440
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:30.140
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.380
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:11.980
The Cursed Gear Mask

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.950
I've been waiting, Yuya.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.660
Dennis? What are you doing here?

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.490
I'm here to fight you, obviously.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.280
Fight? But this is—

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.870
Kurosaki isn't here.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.990
Isn't that right, you guys?

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:30.300
Yeah. Syun went to the Fusion Division.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:35.100
A guy named Reiji Akaba told him about 
some Junior Youth Competition,

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.360
but Syun said he didn't care.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.270
Syun's probably looking for Ruri!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.470
Ruri?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.100
Of course.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.580
Kurosaki doesn't know... what happened.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.150
Got it! The Fusion Dimension, then?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.830
Hold it! Turning your back on an enemy?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.990
You, who claims you'll make everyone smile,

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.850
turning your back on me...

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:02.630
pupil of the age's greatest entertainment 
duelist, Yusyo Sakaki?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.930
Pupil? But your duels are...

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.870
Well? Feel like fighting now?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.670
If you're going, beat me first, at least.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.230
It looks like we even have an audience.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:15.710
Those kids...

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.970
Let's begin, shall we?

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.420
I have no intention of losing, of course!

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.020
Field Spell Crossover.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:30.940
Duel!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.730
I'll go first!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.600
I set the Pendulum Scale

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:41.300
with Scale 2 Performapal Gongato 
and Scale 8 Xiangsheng Magician!

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.740
Now I can summon monsters 
between Levels 3 and 7!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.710
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.310
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.280
Pendulum Summon!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.590
Come out!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.840
Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:03.690
Wow.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.890
I now end my turn!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.090
My turn! Draw!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.800
I summon Performage Bubble 
Gardna from my hand!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.170
What are you doing?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.870
I told you not to watch duels!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.400
Please be good and come back home.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.520
No way!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.710
That nice man from before is dueling!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:35.140
Didn't you say his duels 
were the real thing, too?

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.220
On the same turn that I summon or 
Special Summon a Performage,

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:44.130
I can also Special Summon Performage 
Filmsy Slimmer from my hand!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.210
Hey, Mom... We can, can't we?

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.040
But...

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.570
Don't let the children watch that duel!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.170
How often must I tell you?!

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.830
Come on... Stay away from those people!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.600
I won't let you go.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.410
You can see this, can't you?

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.150
That card!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.600
Yes...

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.040
Do you want to be turned into a card again?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:12.460
If not, you'd better sit there 
and watch the duel!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.430
What are you saying, Dennis?!

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.240
I activate my spell card Polymerization!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:22.920
I choose to fuse Bubble Gardna 
and Filmsy Slimmer.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:27.840
Ephemeral protector, melt into the escape 
artist who cannot be caught,

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.340
and become a new witch who 
can race through the heavens!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:33.140
Fusion Summon!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:37.590
Appear, Level 7 Performage Trapeze Witch!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:42.590
And I activate Equip Spell Ancient Gear Mask

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.260
and equip it to Trapeze Witch!

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:48.660
Battle!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:53.630
I attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon with Trapeze Witch.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.800
Experience the power of evil Fusion Monsters!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.470
I activate Trapeze Witch's monster effect!

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.480
When a Performage does battle,

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.450
it reduces its opponent's 
attack points by 600!

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.080
Action Spell—

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.150
I don't think so.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.750
When a monster equipped with 
Ancient Gear Mask attacks,

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:20.730
you can't activate spell or trap cards 
until the damage step ends.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.660
And when a monster equipped 
with Ancient Gear Mask

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:30.200
destroys another monster by battle, 
battle damage is doubled!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.830
I end my turn...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.580
Now, go ahead. Try to beat me.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:44.470
Me, a student from Academia.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.000
Dennis, why are you...

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.790
It's all Academia's fault.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:50.990
Edo!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:51.980
Hey, Yuya!

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:55.120
The people Academia turned into cards

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:58.020
can only view us as objects of hatred.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.270
They reject us... no, they 
reject dueling itself.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:06.160
But you guys are rebuilding the 
city to atone for that sin—

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.240
People's hearts aren't like the city.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:12.960
You can't just say, "Please forgive me," 
and return things to normal.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:17.720
The scars we left on their 
hearts are too severe.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:21.360
If we could communicate with them 
through our duels, at least,

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:23.810
there might be a way to resolve it, but...

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.660
Wait... You mean, he...

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.430
In that case...

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.160
My turn!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:36.410
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set to Pendulum Summon!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.410
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.510
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:46.610
And from my hand, 
Performapal Miracle Mirrorabbit!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.160
No... Will I be turned into a card again?

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.090
I don't want that.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.280
I don't want to be a card!

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.610
Don't worry.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.250
You won't be turned into a card.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:06.300
So just calm down and watch 
their duel with an open mind.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.210
Battle!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:13.660
I attack Trapeze Witch with 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:20.010
You don't realize that evil Fusion Monsters 
can't be hurt by attacks?

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:25.480
I use Trapeze Witch's effect to reduce 
your monster's attack points by 600.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:29.690
And I activate Miracle 
Mirrorabbit's monster effect!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:33.660
I switch one attack-point changing 
effect to target this card!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.840
You think that stopgap move will work on me?

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:42.520
Once per turn, a monster with Ancient 
Gear Mask can use its effect

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:45.000
to prevent destruction by battle or effects.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.370
But you still take damage!

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.920
When Odd-Eyes does battle with a 
monster of Level 5 or more,

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.840
the damage is doubled!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.530
Reaction Force!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.960
You impudent brat...

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.990
I gave you a little scratch, at least, right?

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.640
But such meager power is not 
enough to extinguish my evil power.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.000
No, the real thing is still coming up!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.700
What?

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.370
Yeah, in other words...

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.180
The mirror magic show!

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:20.470
First, Miracle Mirrorabbit takes the stage!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.970
Huh? Hey! We're in a duel, you know!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:30.490
Now, when Miracle Mirrorabbit 
reflects Odd-Eyes in its mirror...

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.920
Incredible! When Miracle 
Mirrorabbit doesn't attack,

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:41.190
another monster can attack 
a second time instead!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:46.660
Now, Odd-Eyes's second attack, 
borrowing Miracle Mirrorabbit's strength!

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.400
Attack Trapeze Witch!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.160
It will be the same each time.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:55.870
Trapeze Witch's effect reduces 
its attack points by 600!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:58.110
Miracle Mirrorabbit's other effect...

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:01.210
Your attack-point change shifts to this card!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.780
Reaction Force doubles the damage!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.930
What did you think of the mirror 
magic entertainment show?

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.190
So for now, I end my turn.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.570
Next, the Fusion Dimension's greatest 
entertainment duelist,

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.270
Dennis Mackfield, will present to you

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.010
his shocking interdimensional 
entertainment duel!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.250
How dare you introduce me?

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.500
Show it to us!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.680
The real Dennis!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.150
You saw through it all, eh?

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.620
Then, you leave me no choice...

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.690
It's showtime!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.070
My turn.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.740
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:58.550
Scale 2 Performage Reversal Dancer 
and Scale 6 Performage Fire Dancer.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:08.580
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 3 and 5 simultaneously.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.750
Pendulum Summon.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.840
Be reborn from my Extra Deck...

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:17.260
Level 4, Performage Bubble Gardna.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:20.490
Level 4, Performage Filmsy Slimmer.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:26.230
And I overlay my Level 4 Bubble 
Gardna and Filmsy Slimmer!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.400
Now, it's time for the guy I just 
can't do my show without!

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:35.040
The show must go on.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:39.410
Sky magician, travel around 
the stage magnificently.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.480
Xyz Summon!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:46.350
Appear, Rank 4 Performage Trapeze Magician!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.460
How pretty!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:57.460
So cool!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.550
The surprises aren't done yet...

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:07.510
I use one of Trapeze Magician's 
Overlay Units to activate its effect.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:12.480
Now, you can enjoy his 
fancy aerial tricks twice!

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.330
First, one battle.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.460
I attack Miracle Mirrorabbit.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.350
Action Spell Evasion.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.200
I negate your monster's attack!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.390
Yuya...

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:34.200
The fact that you dodged that first 
attack has sealed my victory.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.400
No, we don't know that yet!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.640
I can win.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:41.640
For my second attack, I attack 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.610
Attacking Odd-Eyes?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.320
But they have the same attack points.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.810
What's he after?

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.550
Action Spell Miracle.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.520
My monster isn't destroyed, 
and the damage is halved!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:02.860
In that instant, I activate Quick-Play Spell 
Rank-Up-Magic Magical Force!

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:07.930
I can Special Summon one monster 
destroyed by battle, with effect negated!

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.540
I then can use this monster as a component,

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:14.770
to Xyz Summon one Spellcaster-Type 
Monster of one rank higher.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.410
What?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:17.880
Show must go on!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:22.310
Sky magician, travel around 
even larger stages,

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:24.650
far more magnificently!

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:27.620
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:32.790
Come out, Rank 5 Performage 
Trapeze High Magician!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:37.830
Rank-Up magic! So cool!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.240
I use one of Trapeze High 
Magician's Overlay Units

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.900
to activate its monster effect.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:47.960
This lets Trapeze High Magician 
attack three times on this turn.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:51.210
Wow! Three times!

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.710
This might be the end of it.

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:54.920
I don't think so!

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.800
Yuya will just use Action Cards 
to dodge everything!

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:01.420
Ken, it's dangerous here...

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:03.500
We should go.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.290
You like duels?

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:07.120
It's easier to see from in front of us.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:13.800
Can you keep up with Trapeze High Magician's 
high-speed, acrobatic attacks?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.500
I attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.200
Damn.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.110
I attack Miracle Mirrorabbit!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.040
Now, it's over...

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.880
I attack directly with Trapeze High Magician.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:46.700
I activate Performapal Gongato's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:51.000
When I have no monsters on my field, 
I reduce battle damage to 0!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.740
Yeah! He held out!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.960
I now end my turn.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.040
Well?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.910
More exciting than you expected?

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.180
No, there's even more to go.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:05.380
The fun is only getting started!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.990
My turn!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:14.400
I can use the scale already set to bring 
my monsters back, over and over.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.880
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.700
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:21.640
Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.840
Level 4 Performapal Miracle Mirrorabbit!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.240
And I Normal Summon Performapal Swordfish!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.940
I activate Swordfish's monster effect!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:38.380
Until my End Phase, I reduce the attack 
points of one of your monsters by 600.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.950
Dennis has no cards set or in his hand!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:45.460
Looks like Yuya is going to win.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:49.160
It would be rude to the customers 
to end things right here!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.730
I use one of Trapeze High 
Magician's Overlay Units

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.270
to activate its monster effect!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:00.240
This prevents Trapeze High Magician

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.500
from being destroyed by battle or 
effects, three times this turn!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:11.150
Now, can you climb up to where I am?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.730
Impressive.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:16.380
Yuya cannot destroy it, unless he 
breaks through all three effects.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:18.890
And he only has 100 life remaining.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.040
To break through the effect,

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:25.480
he needs monsters with more attack points 
than Trapeze High Magician has.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:28.090
How many will he need for that?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.100
Odd-Eyes by itself isn't enough.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.580
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.270
Looks like it's time for the climax!

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:41.710
Behold, everyone... Glorious victory
 awaits me on that spire.

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:47.200
First, I must prepare the field for 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon,

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.690
who will carry me there.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:52.860
I activate Continuous Spell 
Challenge Stairs from my hand!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:57.680
When I attack a monster 
without destroying it,

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:02.810
I can tribute one card on my side 
of the field to attack once more.

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:06.500
And I activate Continuous Spell 
Hope Stairs from my hand!

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:10.620
Until my next turn's Standby Phase, 
this increases the attack points,

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:15.710
by 400 points, of one of my 
monsters that's battling yours!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:19.680
And if he uses Xiangsheng 
Magician's Pendulum Effect

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.330
to set Swordfish's level to 4,

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:25.690
he can use that card and Miracle 
Mirrorabbit as components

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.890
to summon Dark Rebellion.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.630
Now, let's battle!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.260
Let's go, Odd-Eyes!

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:44.980
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Trapeze High Magician!

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:50.150
Trapeze High Magician's effect 
prevents destruction by battle.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.590
Even if you negate the destruction, 
you still take damage!

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:03.560
The effect of Hope Stairs increases 
Odd-Eyes's attack points by 400!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.730
I activate Reversal Dancer's Pendulum Effect.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.710
Once, on each of our turns,

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:12.970
when one of your monsters' attack points 
is increased via a card effect,

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:17.940
I can increase the attack points of one monster 
on my field by the same amount!

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.910
Then, I activate Miracle 
Mirrorabbit's effect!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.650
I withdraw this card's attack declaration

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.890
and allow one monster on 
my field to attack twice.

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:31.490
Odd-Eyes's second attack!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:38.490
The effect means Trapeze High 
Magician isn't destroyed,

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:40.200
but you still take the damage.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:47.320
The effect of Hope Stairs increases 
Odd-Eyes's attack points by 400!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.930
I can still go even higher...

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:53.110
The effect of my other Continuous 
Spell, Challenge Stairs,

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:57.400
lets me tribute Xiangsheng Magician 
to attack a third time!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.250
Yeah! He broke through them all!

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.220
And you take the damage.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:11.630
The effect of Hope Stairs increases 
Odd-Eyes's attack points by 400!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.740
Just a little farther! Keep going!

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:14.600
Keep going!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:18.160
Now, Trapeze High Magician's effect is over.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:20.340
But I'm still ready to go!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.770
The effect of Challenge Stairs 
lets me tribute Gongato

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.580
to attack a fourth time!

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:28.430
So close, yet so far!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:32.380
Destroying Trapeze High Magician 
leaves me with 200 life left.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.720
You still lose!

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:36.190
Action Spell Miracle.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.390
What?! When did you...

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:43.060
It's the one you stopped me from getting before. 
I picked it up right before I came.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.760
But Miracle is a card that lets you 
prevent a monster's destruction,

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.930
halving the damage dealt.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.670
How will you use it to win?

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:54.680
That's right... So I activate it, 
targeting Trapeze High Magician!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.070
And you take the damage, 
and Odd-Eyes's attack points

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:04.100
increase by 400, thanks to 
the effect of Hope Stairs!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:07.690
And the fact that I didn't 
destroy your monster

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.250
activates the effect of Challenge Stairs.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:13.190
I tribute Swordfish and take my fifth attack.

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.190
This is the show's big finale!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:20.600
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Trapeze High Magician!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.960
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.760
He did it!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:57.110
As a family, we once climbed 
to that viewing platform.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:02.140
Yes... The day I won the duel tournament.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.380
At that time, you said,

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:09.850
"I'm going to keep dueling for 
the whole family to enjoy."

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.490
Yeah!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.600
Hey, teach me how to fight 
entertainment duels.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.890
You got it!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.710
And after we have a fun duel,

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:34.950
Professor Dennis will teach you 
all about entertainment duels.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.260
Please, Dennis...

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:45.720
Teach them the true entertainment 
duels that my father taught you!

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:47.800
Yuya...

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:52.360
Okay, let's do it!

00:22:08.150 --> 00:22:11.160
Thank you... Yuya.

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:18.170
Never-Ending Rebellion
